; RT13 / PT13 (#687): ADR 0046.2 and PT13, points 2-6.
; Expectations calculated independently, without running Tecnigrafo.
; Liberation Sans Regular 2.1.5: fontTools reads OS/2, hhea, cmap and hmtx.
; cap=1409, ascent=1854, descent=-434; advances(A)=1366, (B)=1366,
; (C)=1479, (space)=569. Width=sum(advances)/1409*height.
; Each generated Text box uses y=[-434/1409,1854/1409]*height,
; then rotation and translation (ADR 0022.4-5). No kerning.

; PT5 B01: one decoding pass; unknown and unterminated codes stay literal.
